<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀβασάνιστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not tortured,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. θνῄσκειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					1.32.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.275c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κημοῖς ὑπερῴαν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					13.9
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>
			<i>without pain,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλέπειν τὸν ἥλιον</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				10.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>untried, unexamined,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τι ἐᾶσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					1.13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπολιπεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					4.75.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραλείπειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.59c
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				<i>without due examination,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.20
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.28b
			</span></i>.</div>
